cs, Sheets and Slides download as .docx, .xlsx and .pptx.\"},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"const\":\"upload\"},\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A file under outputs/\",\"minLength\":1},\"folder\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A folder's file handle; without it, the whole drive, or its root for upload\",\"minLength\":1},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The new file's name; default the local file's name\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":255}},\"required\":[\"command\",\"path\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"Upload a file from outputs/ as a new file. Returns its handle. Changes the person's data; can be undone.\"}]},\"strict\":false}]},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"id\":\"rs_033a60f0ad849e28016af129c526e087d0bde4efd7d3377802\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8SnHYPjc-rAryF9PwAMpMd22HXEV3_Ls_GlSn-fGjxfdKsLSsGhT9rylTO5jwdYijDrTzna_62bq7b8FbEmeetLsvqxQfI2NeNtrjSDESar07SZYlE64vNTZaNfS2jTtAoJvtjCktaJNw4Vxy-i2E0XUNkdwnUWJ6CAGk6ROlMVDGuSUF0yOcu0Po2-lxq4mI7hfLnKocXoHcN-Saks5zJgfMuocPwEAgKpLtvXVH8EOEhF5vefBlfCK118wpCkO_rKPLMJnI1WEdSfXyC7TofO1GgJMLdguOuT8I8xWnDh9qrpjk0JcmY44xtj542RgPzLN-T2xf3jFGne-ULTFvaq1kfeWQ6Ly0jDGlgAEnchApjMm1fmViNNE5Jtw2xcSwXgZIkIAK30yJ6hUBGQgmlw8WLxmkUHQoWTp2sjWLp1RTrUTG5TGNbi9-5GB0UMdOIymaR5tuXcnTaTWj2vXRhDIorr4Q3PGcm_W2Af40DGPgIIRlOLdoUhLAMEglfNUyUVnquz5wdy7PzSMY5lFtSGUT3KRz-98eJfiBDEXvV8T3GxTVdCln4zX1zLwOBDCPON8BVm7Tj2-I-jIwBpB3mu-B0Z-urFt_N8K0iPyauLmc_Zw_vZitY7LcmGuJDufQYtsuiTOv9wNLOjZdRU-g6n_-lnDjWcUAIy8z-AIprqkuJfdKvqbVBXWCMJhrMOWb8iicXbYmHnhVpKqyTrGEbArGucM775wp8sEvktDBBmemhesAKHu9Cd6wOOIXnbqNDWpgNtatyc9Cz0qCeI9nt3GkMIqf_PHVwaYpPvG2LnWW4Bythl_Q6jLfO7hAi73XGbM_CnvaZlFpuNrOO3A44-cADQB8H4m6gO4WA_OIGm4hGP74bX8GGTn9abxkQmOky1Ybm9vvMMaCjI7L8_r5Lapb7V2LHapdFjP50iOhqe-KYJm8-TKKq-serx-CsKZE4fvD_fXBoR4YTj1LY1k96EbyvA4T-1laTOq0Q7hMZd_jW8oynzmTr8cLVSriz4tNXe6QaMT1DInhnucA489eUUkhBdLv8LQoPFiQTdp_DLDE_FK4