also check the thread for details and confirm what Dana's emails discuss, especially regarding the budget.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying Calendar Events**\\n\\nIt looks like the calendar indicates tomorrow's date is likely November 10, 2026. I plan to use UTC for this. I could list events from November 10 at midnight UTC to November 11 at midnight, considering any local timezone shifts. It might work to include a broader range to account for local variations. I need to understand the timezone based on the returned email timestamp at 8:12 UTC, confirming that events will be scheduled for the 10th. Let's proceed with this approach!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_033a60f0ad849e28016af129d4542887d0b3fb0469a22414a6\",\"call_id\":\"call_TnMGc1uVjMcgnxqeKnkFQfCa\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"msg_a5dcfdb1bd0b43f2\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_033a60f0ad849e28016af129d4543c87d0a75c060d11215b3b\",\"call_id\":\"call_90vZso7cQo36jKCpitzIybNH\",\"name\":\"calendar\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_TnMGc1uVjMcgnxqeKnkFQfCa\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_a5dcfdb1bd0b43f2\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_83214094f3c24ce7\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"body\\\": {\\n        \\\"text\\\": \\\"Hi Sam,\\\\n\\\\nCan you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review? Finance wants the Q3 travel line.\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nDana\\\",\\n        \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n        \\\"limit_chars\\\": 20000\\n      },\\n      \\\"attachments\\\": []\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_90vZso7cQo36jKCpitzIybNH\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_9c38ea5e5486494a\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Team standup\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:15:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"lee@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Lee Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_ccb7ac4f2a774682\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Q3 planning review\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T14:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T15:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Room 4\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be0b-0e5a-74ee-a458-651a75938ac8\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
