4kG5hFH_1b-ea46KzGRgU1wMMXLJnQTGhN-N18GfpvdQDw_879YZZhuY1IF1AfA7PCIlxNdAzT-46pXtVTLzCAYT0NBLvwA8MYz-MtL-qa7Qasxue3cBrZIaDqDc-hPcMDFkFe1XhAJtVqlZX3Om5xwO140hkEwGIdypfMrf6IfrzWpwEXmJghBtxEOlhlfm-Xmm7N4FJZymObDJDW6p4cp6ZhI8itJaejcLpLRRjfQ2sWRf8EkKr05W9vAi32m2_R4347dqTSn5XR_10pnwU95ra6Ypei-NetqUaNQB1ssg9g4GEN0OqzExYzy_aNHjTKq-W4bMwB1TynjTm9aMB6eKE0_6w4iQS6VDySEe3sXEOY_fJxf2J6NgPmSfykcqadsQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Drafting email reply**\\n\\nI need to draft a reply to Dana with the proper link. First off, I'll ensure that I'm using the correct message handling for the recipient. I'll include the exact link for the budget sheet, which should be https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget. The subject will likely be \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers.\\\" I might need to mention event information for tomorrow as well. My plan is to create the draft, but definitely not send it yet. Let's get to it!\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_033a60f0ad849e28016af129dac19487d0bb032aff4463704b\",\"call_id\":\"call_NYzAgX75qdRrCqcFEzZZf8Sv\",\"name\":\"mail\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"draft\\\",\\\"to\\\":[\\\"dana@example.test\\\"],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\n\\\\nI’ll bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review tomorrow. Here’s the sheet: https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\\n\\\\nBest,\\\\nSam\\\",\\\"reply_to\\\":\\\"msg_a5dcfdb1bd0b43f2\\\"}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_NYzAgX75qdRrCqcFEzZZf8Sv\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"draft\\\": \\\"msg_a357d42185b3414c\\\",\\n  \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_83214094f3c24ce7\\\",\\n  \\\"to\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\"\\n}\"},{\"type\":\"configuration_update\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"stream\":true,\"prompt_cache_key\":\"01a1be0b-0e5a-74ee-a458-651a75938ac8\",\"store\":false,\"max_output_tokens\":128000,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"medium\",\"summary\":\"auto\"},\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"]}"
